@startuml
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "User" as U
participant ":System" as S

title UC09 이슈 상태 변경 - SSD

U -> S : changeStatus(issueId, newStatus)

alt 유효하지 않은 상태 전환
  S --> U : errorCode (InvalidTransition)
else 권한 없음
  S --> U : errorCode (Unauthorized)
else 이슈 없음
  S --> U : errorCode (NotFound)
else 성공
  S --> U : updatedStatus
@enduml